  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASCE-LC Burkina support in project financial and technical management 2018-2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ASCE-LC Burkina support in project financial and technical management 2018-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta bidrag &#xe4;r en internationell upphandling f&#xf6;r rekrytering av tv&#xe5; tekniska assistanser till huvudprojektet ASCE-LC 2017-2019 (bidrag 10953). De st&#xf6;der ekonomisk f&#xf6;rvaltning i 6 m&#xe5;nader och projektledning i ett &#xe5;r. Det ekonomiska st&#xf6;det kommer att ske genom en teknisk r&#xe5;dgivares arbetsplats. Projektledningstj&#xe4;nsten kommer att ske genom interaktioner under en period av ett &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is an international procurement for the recruitment of two technical assistances to ASCE-LC main project 2017-2019 (contribution 10953). They are supports on financial management for 6 months and project management for one year. The financial support will be done through the work placement of a technical advisor. The project management support will be done through interactions during a period of one year.</narrative>
  </description>
